# Unit15
# 领域: 考研
# 学科: 英语词汇
# 来源: 2024红宝书考研英语词汇
# 描述: 基础词Unit15核心词汇

equip/ɪˈkwɪp/装备；配备/The lab is equipped with modern instruments.
era/ˈɪrə/时代；纪元/We are living in the digital era.
error/ˈerər/错误/There are several errors in the report.
escape/ɪˈskeɪp/逃跑；逃避/The prisoner tried to escape from jail.
especially/ɪˈspeʃəli/特别；尤其/I love fruit, especially apples.
essay/ˈeseɪ/论文；散文/She wrote an essay on climate change.
essential/ɪˈsenʃl/必要的；本质的/Water is essential for life.
establish/ɪˈstæblɪʃ/建立/The university was established in 1900.
estimate/ˈestɪmeɪt/估计/The cost is estimated at one million dollars.
evaluate/ɪˈvæljueɪt/评估/We need to evaluate the results carefully.
even/ˈiːvn/甚至；平坦的/Even a child can understand this.
event/ɪˈvent/事件；活动/The charity event was a great success.
eventually/ɪˈventʃuəli/最终/He eventually found a job after months of searching.
evidence/ˈevɪdəns/证据/There is strong evidence to support the theory.
evil/ˈiːvl/邪恶的/The character in the movie is pure evil.
evolution/ˌevəˈluːʃn/进化；发展/The theory of evolution was proposed by Darwin.
evolve/ɪˈvɑːlv/进化；发展/Technology continues to evolve rapidly.
exact/ɪɡˈzækt/确切的；精确的/What is the exact time of the meeting?
exam/ɪɡˈzæm/考试/She passed the exam with flying colors.
examine/ɪɡˈzæmɪn/检查；审查/The doctor examined the patient carefully.
example/ɪɡˈzæmpl/例子/Can you give me an example?
exceed/ɪkˈsiːd/超过/Sales exceeded our expectations this year.
excellent/ˈeksələnt/优秀的/She did an excellent job on the project.
except/ɪkˈsept/除了/Everyone passed the exam except Tom.
exchange/ɪksˈtʃeɪndʒ/交换/They exchanged gifts at the party.
excite/ɪkˈsaɪt/使兴奋/The news excited everyone in the room.
exclude/ɪkˈskluːd/排除/The price excludes tax and delivery fees.
excuse/ɪkˈskjuːs/借口；原谅/He always makes excuses for being late.
execute/ˈeksɪkjuːt/执行/The plan was executed perfectly.
exercise/ˈeksərsaɪz/锻炼；练习/Regular exercise is good for health.
exhaust/ɪɡˈzɔːst/使筋疲力尽；排气/The long hike exhausted everyone.
exhibit/ɪɡˈzɪbɪt/展览；展示/The museum exhibits rare paintings.
exist/ɪɡˈzɪst/存在/Do aliens really exist?
expand/ɪkˈspænd/扩展/The company plans to expand its business.
expect/ɪkˈspekt/期望；预料/I expect to finish the work by Friday.
expense/ɪkˈspens/费用；开支/Travel expenses will be covered by the company.
experience/ɪkˈspɪriəns/经历；经验/She has ten years of teaching experience.
experiment/ɪkˈsperɪmənt/实验/The scientist conducted an important experiment.
expert/ˈekspɜːrt/专家/He is an expert in computer science.
explain/ɪkˈspleɪn/解释/Can you explain this rule to me?
explicit/ɪkˈsplɪsɪt/明确的/The instructions are very explicit.
explode/ɪkˈsˈloʊd/爆炸/The bomb exploded at midnight.
explore/ɪkˈsplɔːr/探索/They explored the ancient ruins together.
export/ɪkˈspɔːrt/出口/The country exports oil to many nations.
expose/ɪkˈspoʊz/暴露；揭露/The report exposed the corruption.
express/ɪkˈspres/表达；快递/She expressed her gratitude to the team.
extend/ɪkˈstend/延长；扩展/The deadline has been extended by one week.
extent/ɪkˈstent/程度；范围/To what extent do you agree with this view?
external/ɪkˈstɜːrnl/外部的/External factors can affect the outcome.
extra/ˈekstrə/额外的/You need to pay extra for the service.
